        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute pixel heroes that live on your desktop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idlewood Outpost is an idle desktop pet game where a band of pixel RPG heroes guard your taskbar, collect loot, and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.poster.avif?t=1763376044\" width=720 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.webm?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.mp4?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle by Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game run while you work, study, or doomscroll. Your heroes will patrol, battle, and level up all on their own — no punishment, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a tiny fantasy outpost existing quietly in the corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.poster.avif?t=1763376044\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.webm?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.mp4?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional Depth, Cozy Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you do feel like checking in, there’s loot to hoover up, artifacts to find, new heroes and mounts to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no penalties or stress — just the occasional dopamine rush when you find a rare artifact or level up a hero!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Growing World In Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an evolving game. Planned updates include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• More unique heroes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• More mounts, artifacts &amp; monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Personal housing you can decorate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.poster.avif?t=1763376044\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.webm?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute pixel heroes that live on your desktop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idlewood Outpost is an idle desktop pet game where a band of pixel RPG heroes guard your taskbar, collect loot, and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.poster.avif?t=1763376044\" width=720 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.webm?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.mp4?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle by Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game run while you work, study, or doomscroll. Your heroes will patrol, battle, and level up all on their own — no punishment, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a tiny fantasy outpost existing quietly in the corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.poster.avif?t=1763376044\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.webm?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.mp4?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional Depth, Cozy Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you do feel like checking in, there’s loot to hoover up, artifacts to find, new heroes and mounts to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no penalties or stress — just the occasional dopamine rush when you find a rare artifact or level up a hero!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Growing World In Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an evolving game. Planned updates include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• More unique heroes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• More mounts, artifacts &amp; monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Personal housing you can decorate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.poster.avif?t=1763376044\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/96b734404675b02c3f9073e23768d8a2.webm?t=1763376044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
